hold item * clip tuck_l side left bone chest grip 0.5000 0.5000 0.5000 offset -0.08000 -0.13000 0.24000 rot 0.00000 0.00000 0.00000 scale 0.2400
hold item torch clip * side right bone arm_r_palm grip 0.5000 0.1387 0.5000 offset 0.00000 -0.02000 0.04000 rot 0.20000 0.00000 0.00000 scale 0.4200
hold item torch clip * side left bone arm_l_palm grip 0.5000 0.1387 0.5000 offset 0.00000 -0.02000 0.04000 rot 0.20000 0.00000 0.00000 scale 0.4200
hold item torch clip raise_r side right bone arm_r_palm grip 0.5000 0.1387 0.5000 offset 0.00000 -0.02000 0.04000 rot 0.20000 0.00000 0.00000 scale 0.4200
hold item torch clip raise_r side left bone arm_l_palm grip 0.5000 0.1387 0.5000 offset 0.00000 -0.02000 0.04000 rot 0.20000 0.00000 0.00000 scale 0.4200
