hold item target_dummy clip * side right bone arm_r_palm grip 0.5000 0.0600 0.5000 offset 0.00000 -0.02000 0.04000 rot 0.00000 0.00000 0.00000 scale 0.5200
hold item target_dummy clip * side left bone arm_l_palm grip 0.5000 0.0600 0.5000 offset 0.00000 -0.02000 0.04000 rot 0.00000 0.00000 0.00000 scale 0.5200
